{"created": "2018-03-14T12:56:09.869532+00:00", "modified": "2020-01-24T19:26:10.256908+00:00", "id": 1198158, "conceptrecid": "1198157", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.1198157", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "metadata": {"title": "Simulation data for CHARMM36 POPC bilayer, 100 lipids/leaflet, 310K, GROMACS 5.1.4", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "publication_date": "2018-03-14", "description": "<p>Simulations of a POPC bilayer without ions with CHARMM36 FF from the CHARMM-Gui.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>The first from the set of 6 simulations.</p>\n\n<p>The goal was to study the effect of scaling the CHARMM FF on the ion binding.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Done for the NMRlipids project, see&nbsp;<br>\nhttp://nmrlipids.blogspot.fi for more information.</p>\n\n<p>A POPC bilayer consisting of 200 lipids (100 per leaflet)&nbsp;<br>\nis simulated. The Charmm36&nbsp;<br>\nmodel&nbsp; is employed for lipids, the Charmm compatible variant&nbsp;<br>\nof the tip3p model for water.</p>\n\n<p>The Charmm36 force field parameters were obtained from&nbsp;http://charmm-gui.org/</p>\n\n<p>&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;&ndash;</p>\n\n<p>The files are in GROMACS format. Trajectory (.xtc) is&nbsp;<br>\n380 ns long with data saved every 100 ps.</p>\n\n<p>the initial&nbsp;structure (.gro), topology (.top), index file (.ndx),&nbsp;<br>\nsimulation paremeter file (.mdp), binary run input file&nbsp;<br>\nfor GROMACS v. 5.1&ndash;&gt; (.tpr) and the energy output file&nbsp;<br>\n(.edr) are provided.&nbsp;</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Nencini, Ricky", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "communities": [{"id": "nmrlipids"}], "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "1198157"}}]}}, "title": "Simulation data for CHARMM36 POPC bilayer, 100 lipids/leaflet, 310K, GROMACS 5.1.4", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1198158", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1198158?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.1198158", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198157", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1198157", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.1198157", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.1198157", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:1198158/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:1198158/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/media-files", "archive": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/files-archive", "archive_media": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/media-files-archive", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/1198158/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/1198158/access"